---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Disclaimer" description="Limits of SecureByteGuide digital-safety information, comparisons, tools, and external links.">
  <article class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-16 md:py-24 max-w-3xl">
    <header class="mb-12"><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] font-mono text-accent mb-4">SecureByteGuide · Trust</p><h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold leading-[0.95] mb-4" style="font-family:var(--font-display);">Disclaimer</h1><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last updated: September 6, 2026</p></header>
    <div class="prose-article space-y-8 text-[16px] leading-[1.75]">
<section><h2>General information</h2><p>SecureByteGuide explains security, privacy, backup, authentication, fraud-response, and account-recovery concepts for a general audience. It does not replace instructions from an account provider, device maker, employer, school, financial institution, emergency service, attorney, insurer, or incident-response professional.</p></section>
<section><h2>No security or recovery guarantee</h2><p>Following a guide can reduce some risks but cannot make a device, network, or account immune to compromise. A score or checklist result is a self-assessment based on the answers provided, not a scan, audit, certification, or warranty. Recovery timing and outcomes depend on facts, provider controls, payment methods, evidence, and jurisdiction.</p></section>
<section><h2>Testing and comparisons</h2><p>Unless an article explicitly states a documented method and evidence, product comparisons summarize cited documentation and public sources rather than first-hand laboratory or long-term use. Prices, features, interfaces, and policies can change. Confirm current terms before purchasing or changing a critical setup.</p></section>
<section><h2>External links and commissions</h2><p>External links are offered for context and convenience. SecureByteGuide does not control their availability, accuracy, security, or privacy practices. Some links may generate a commission without changing the price paid by the reader; see the <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.</p></section>
<section><h2>Contact</h2><p>Report a factual error, unsafe ambiguity, or broken source to <a href="mailto:editor@securebyteguide.org">editor@securebyteguide.org</a> with the article URL.</p></section></div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
